    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the RuneChild, born with the power of the Runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was carved into your very bones when you were just a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one from 12 Awesome Powers, which grows as you use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more games you play, The more and more you want buy this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read about the Crafting many, unique Sword and other things below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is one of the Many Cool enemies: The Butcher Guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.poster.avif?t=1753874549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.webm?t=1753874549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.mp4?t=1753874549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the RuneChild, born with the power of the Runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It was carved into your very bones when you were just a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select one from 12 Awesome Powers, which grows as you use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Kaelthar</i>\u2014a land full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path: pick your race, your class, and exciting quests to go on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own hero with special skills, cool weapons, and powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use swords, spells, or potions to fight monsters and protect the world from danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more games you play, The more and more you want buy this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>An Awesome Open-World RPG filled with Unique Demons and Powerful Dragons.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices Matter</strong> in this funny Sandbox type RPG, where you can take many different paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization</strong> is easy, with many different weapons, (Some you can make yourself), Many different colors for clothes, hats and armor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read about the Crafting many, unique Sword and other things below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is one of the Many Cool enemies: The Butcher Guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.poster.avif?t=1753874549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.webm?t=1753874549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/55f892352fc9f0230a4e783a5dbb790c.mp4?t=1753874549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic in this game is easy and wild\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features things like crafting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sword Crafting</strong>, where you can create your own sword from +250,000 Unique combinations. Swords and Armors can also be Improved with smiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alchemy Crafting</strong>, with over 100,000 possible combinations to make a wide variety of potions. A cheap way to make money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spell Crafting</strong>, with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the RuneChild RPG. <br>You can play it casually\u2014taking your time to explore the world and complete quests\u2014or go full hardcore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s also a <strong>Fight Arena</strong> for players who want to dive straight into the action and face demons, monsters, and dragons with nothing but a simple sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between\u00a0<strong>Fighter, Ranger,\u00a0Rogue,</strong> or <strong>Wizard</strong>, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>",
